# IngeCAD snap — strict confinement, wrapping the PyInstaller bundle.
# Staged by the CI (release.yml, job "snap"): @VERSION@ substituted, the
# onedir bundle in ./payload, desktop entry in snap/gui/. The bundle
# carries its own Qt AND the LibreDWG converters (vendor/libredwg/bin,
# rebuilt from source in CI); stage-packages cover GL dispatch, the xcb
# chain and fonts that a bare core22 lacks.
name: ingecad
base: core22
version: "@VERSION@"
title: IngeCAD
summary: CAD 2D libre con DWG nativo — el espíritu del AutoCAD clásico
description: |
  IngeCAD es un CAD 2D libre (GPL-3.0) para ingenieros civiles y
  arquitectos que migran de AutoCAD: los mismos alias de comandos (M para
  mover, TR para recortar), la interfaz clásica pre-ribbon — menús, barras
  y una línea de comandos de verdad — y DWG/DXF NATIVOS de ida y vuelta
  con GNU LibreDWG: los planos que te manda tu colega abren, se editan y
  se devuelven en su formato.

  Lo que trae:

  - Dibujo 2D con inferencias, referencias a objetos y medidas exactas por
    línea de comandos.
  - DWG y DXF de fábrica, sin conversores externos ni peajes.
  - Capas, bloques, cotas y textos al estilo clásico.
  - Interfaz en español, pensada para el flujo de obra.

  Parte del ecosistema Inge, junto a IngeTrazo (modelado 3D/BIM) e
  IngePresupuestos (presupuestos de obra): terreno → trazo → BIM →
  presupuesto.

  IngeCAD is a free, open-source 2D CAD in the spirit of classic AutoCAD,
  with native DWG/DXF round-tripping powered by GNU LibreDWG, the classic
  pre-ribbon interface and the command aliases your muscle memory expects.
  Spanish-first UI, English available.

  AutoCAD is a trademark of Autodesk, Inc.; IngeCAD is an independent
  project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Autodesk.
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
website: https://ingecad.org
contact: https://github.com/ingelibre/ingecad/issues
source-code: https://github.com/ingelibre/ingecad
issues: https://github.com/ingelibre/ingecad/issues
grade: stable
confinement: strict

apps:
  ingecad:
    command: opt/ingecad/ingecad
    plugs:
      - opengl
      - x11
      - wayland
      - desktop
      - desktop-legacy
      - home
      - network
      - removable-media
    environment:
      QT_QPA_PLATFORM: xcb
      FONTCONFIG_PATH: $SNAP/etc/fonts

parts:
  bundle:
    plugin: dump
    source: payload
    override-build: |
      mkdir -p "$CRAFT_PART_INSTALL/opt/ingecad"
      cp -a "$CRAFT_PART_SRC/." "$CRAFT_PART_INSTALL/opt/ingecad/"
    stage-packages:
      - libgl1
      - libegl1
      - libopengl0
      - libx11-6
      - libx11-xcb1
      - libxcb-glx0
      - libxkbcommon-x11-0
      - libxcb-cursor0
      - libxcb-icccm4
      - libxcb-keysyms1
      - libxcb-shape0
      - libxcb-render-util0
      - libfontconfig1
      - fontconfig-config
      - fonts-dejavu-core
